{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52253","headline":"诗（幷序） 十四 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百岁乃有一人，得七十者稀。\n张眼看他死，不能自觉知。\n痴皮裹脓血，顽骨强相随。\n两步行衣架，步步入阿鼻。\n双盲不识鬼，伺命急来追。\n赤绳串着项，反缚棒脊（一作「背」）皮。\n露头赤脚走，身上无衣被。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}